<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
  <head>
    <title>Smithsonian Astrophysical Observatory Telescope Data Center Home</title>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-type" content="text/html;charset=UTF-8" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/formal.css" type="text/css" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/gavo_dc.css" type="text/css" /><script src="/static/js/jquery-gavo.js" type="text/javascript"></script><script src="/static/js/gavo.js" type="text/javascript"></script>

	<style type="text/css">
		.panel {
			position: relative;
			background-color: #EAEBEE;
			margin-top: 0px;
			min-height:70ex;
			margin-left: 5px;
			padding: 5px;
		}

		.infolink {
			text-decoration: none;
			color: #333;
			white-space: nowrap;
			background-color: #eee;
			border: 1pt solid #aaa;
			padding: 1pt 3pt 1pt 3pt;
			font-size: 80%;
		}

		.srvDesc {
			margin-top: 4pt;
			margin-bottom: 4pt;
		}
	</style>

	<script type="text/javascript">
		function makePanelShower(panelId) {
			return function (){
				$(".panel").css("display", "none");
				$("#"+panelId).css("display", "block");
			}
		}
			
		$(document).ready(function() {
			$("#tabset_tabs li").bind("click", makeTabCallback({
				'by-subject': makePanelShower("subject-list"),
				'by-title': makePanelShower("title-list"),
			}));
			$("#tabset_tabs li a").removeAttr("href");
			makePanelShower("title-list")();
		});
	</script>

  </head>
  <body>
		<div id="header">
			<img src="/static/img/logo_medium.png" alt="[operator logo]" class="logo headlinelogo" />
			<h1 id="pagehead">Smithsonian Astrophysical Observatory Telescope Data Center</h1>
		</div>
		<div><span class="plainmeta">This datacenter is meant to provide access to spectra and images
collected with optical/infrared spectrographs installed on CfA's
ground-based telescopes</span></div>

		<p>Please check out our <a href="/static/help.shtml">site help</a>.
		<span>
		Data <a href="/__system__/dc_tables/list/form">on this site</a> can 
		also be queried through <a href="/tap">TAP</a> and an
		<a href="/adql">ADQL form</a>.</span></p>

		<hr />
		<h2>Services available here</h2>

		<div class="container">
		<ul id="tabset_tabs">
        <li class="selected"><a href="#title-list" name="by-title"><span>By Title</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="#subject-list" name="by-subject"><span>By Subject</span></a></li>
		</ul>

		<div id="title-list" class="panel">
				<h3>C...</h3>
				<ul><li>
						

						

						
							<a title="Resource information" class="serviceref" href="http://oirsa.cfa.harvard.edu:8080/echelle/echelle_public.ssap.q/ssa/info">CfA Reticon Echelle Spectra</a>
						

						<div class="srvDesc"> Optical echelle spectra collected with the CfA Digital Speedometer on
the 1.5m Oak Ridge, 1.5m Tillinghast, and 4.5m MMT telescopes</div>
					</li></ul>
			
				<h3>F...</h3>
				<ul><li>
						

						

						
							<a title="Resource information" class="serviceref" href="http://oirsa.cfa.harvard.edu:8080/fast/fast_public.ssap.q/ssa/info">FLWO FAST Spectra</a>
						

						<div class="srvDesc"> Optical spectra collected with the FAST spectrograph on the F.L.
Whipple Observatory 1.5m Tillinghast telescope</div>
					</li></ul>
			
				<h3>P...</h3>
				<ul><li>
						

						
							<a title="Use the service" class="serviceref" href="/echelle/echelle_public.ssap.q/web/form">Public Data Archive of Processed Echelle Spectra</a>
							<span class="sep"> </span>
							<a title="Resource information" class="infolink" href="http://oirsa.cfa.harvard.edu:8080/echelle/echelle_public.ssap.q/web/info">Service Info</a>
						

						

						<div class="srvDesc"> Optical echelle spectra collected with the CfA Digital Speedometer on
the 1.5m Oak Ridge, 1.5m Tillinghast, and 4.5m MMT telescopes</div>
					</li><li>
						

						
							<a title="Use the service" class="serviceref" href="/fast/fast_public.ssap.q/web/form">Public Data Archive of Processed FAST Spectra</a>
							<span class="sep"> </span>
							<a title="Resource information" class="infolink" href="http://oirsa.cfa.harvard.edu:8080/fast/fast_public.ssap.q/web/info">Service Info</a>
						

						

						<div class="srvDesc"> Optical spectra collected with the FAST spectrograph on the F.L.
Whipple Observatory 1.5m Tillinghast telescope</div>
					</li><li>
						

						
							<a title="Use the service" class="serviceref" href="/hectochelle/hectochelle_public.ssap.q/web/form">Public Data Archive of Processed Hectochelle Spectra</a>
							<span class="sep"> </span>
							<a title="Resource information" class="infolink" href="http://oirsa.cfa.harvard.edu:8080/hectochelle/hectochelle_public.ssap.q/web/info">Service Info</a>
						

						

						<div class="srvDesc"> Optical spectra collected with the multi-fiber Hectochelle
Spectrograph at the MMT 6.5m telescope</div>
					</li><li>
						

						
							<a title="Use the service" class="serviceref" href="/hectospec/hectospec_public.ssap.q/web/form">Public Data Archive of Processed Hectospec Spectra</a>
							<span class="sep"> </span>
							<a title="Resource information" class="infolink" href="http://oirsa.cfa.harvard.edu:8080/hectospec/hectospec_public.ssap.q/web/info">Service Info</a>
						

						

						<div class="srvDesc"> Optical spectra collected with the multi-fiber Hectospec Spectrograph
at the MMT 6.5m telescope</div>
					</li></ul>
			
				<h3>S...</h3>
				<ul><li>
						

						

						
							<a title="Resource information" class="serviceref" href="http://oirsa.cfa.harvard.edu:8080/__system__/tap/run/info">Smithsonian Astrophysical Observatory Telescope Data Center TAP service</a>
						

						<div class="srvDesc">The Smithsonian Astrophysical Observatory Telescope Data Center's TAP end point. The Table Access
Protocol (TAP) lets you execute queries against our database tables,
inspect various metadata, and upload your own data. It is thus the
VO's premier way to access public data holdings.

Tables exposed through this endpoint include: data_public from the echelle schema, data_public from the fast schema, data_public from the hectospec schema, obscore from the ivoa schema, m31 from the m31_proj schema, columns, groups, key_columns, keys, schemas, tables from the tap_schema schema.</div>
					</li><li>
						

						
							<a title="Use the service" class="serviceref" href="/m31_proj/m31_proj.scs.q/cone/form">Star clusters and other objects in M31 field</a>
							<span class="sep"> </span>
							<a title="Resource information" class="infolink" href="http://oirsa.cfa.harvard.edu:8080/m31_proj/m31_proj.scs.q/cone/info">Service Info</a>
						

						

						<div class="srvDesc"> This catalog contains derived information and access to spectra for a
catalog of objects in the field of M31, drawn from the study of star
clusters, HII regions, PNe and individual stars in M31 done with
Hectospec on the MMT by Nelson Caldwell and a host of others.</div>
					</li></ul>
			</div>

